/ locals: current_server
.card
  .card-body.text-center.py-5
    - if server_manageable?(current_server)
      i.bi.bi-arrow-up-circle.display-4.text-warning.mb-3.d-block
      h4.mb-2 This server needs updating
      p.text-muted.mx-auto style="max-width: 34rem;"
        | #{current_server.server_id} is running an older version of ESM than these pages are built for. Everything
          here talks to the server in ways it doesn't understand yet, so none of it works until the server is on
          #{ServerVersion::MINIMUM_SERVER_VERSION} or newer.

      .d-flex.gap-2.justify-content-center.flex-wrap
        = link_to "/docs/server_setup", class: "btn btn-primary"
          i.bi.bi-book.me-1
          | How to update
    - else
      i.bi.bi-hourglass.display-4.text-secondary.mb-3.d-block
      h4.mb-2 Nothing here yet
      p.text-muted.mx-auto.mb-0 style="max-width: 34rem;"
        | #{current_server.server_id} needs an update from its admins before any of this works. Nothing is wrong on
          your end - check back once they've done it.
